          "text": "🇫🇷 Yesterday, progressives made their mark across France. The PES congratulates all the socialist mayors elected, including \n\n🌹Emmanuel Grégoire in Paris,\n🌹Benoît Payan in Marseille, \n🌹Nathalie Appéré in Rennes, \n🌹Michaël Delafosse in Montpellier, \n🌹Arnaud Deslandes in Lille, \n🌹Johanna Rolland in Nantes, \nand many others.\n\nYour leadership will help strengthen public services, drive ecological transition, and ensure communities thrive. A strong progressive presence at the local level is a win for citizens and communities across Europe.\n\n@partisocialiste @placepublique_ @nathalieappere  \n1/2"
